      'charge.text1': "1 faʻaeaʻaraʻa faʻaʻī uira i tātaʻihia (~{min} min pauroa) i te hōʻē vāhi faʻaʻī vitiviti.",
      'charge.textN': "{n} faʻaeaʻaraʻa faʻaʻī uira i tātaʻihia (~{min} min pauroa) i te mau vāhi faʻaʻī vitiviti.",
      'form.legDistance.label': "Ātea rahi roa i rotopū i te mau vāhi faʻaeaʻa",
