      'charge.dataNote': "Mau vāhi faʻaʻī uira : māramarama nō Open Charge Map, ʻaita i ʻaifāito i te mau fenua — a hiʻo e vai ra anei e e tūʻati anei nā mua aʻe i te reva.",
      'van.notice': "Pereʻoʻo fare : te teitei, te roa, te toʻaha e te mau tāpaʻo auahi e nehenehe e tāʻotiʻoti i te tomoraʻa i te tahi mau purumu, ʻāpoʻo purumu, ʻeʻa mouʻa ʻe aore rā rōpū ʻoire. A hiʻo nā mua aʻe i te reva.",
      'days.overMaxPerCity': "E rahi atu te mau mahana i roto i te tahi mau ʻoire i te rahi roa no te ʻoire tātaʻitahi: aita e rava te mau ʻoire faufaa no te roa o teie tere.",
