      'moto.noMotorwayCc': "{name} : te mau purumu rahi ʻōpanihia i te mau pereʻoʻo tātaʻahi mātini i raro aʻe i te {cc} cm³, a hiʻo nō tō ʻoe pereʻoʻo.",
